      "composition": "multiple-figures",
      "description": "Christ in a blue mantle over a red robe sits at the right of a gray Gothic throne with orange-red pinnacles and a gabled back, and sets a crown on Mary, who sits at the left in a white mantle patterned with red and blue florets over a peach robe, hands crossed on her chest. Two standing angels in blue and green flank each side and two more kneel in front of the white marble base; all have burnished gold haloes. The miniature's blue ground is removed and the background is transparent.",
