      "composition": "standalone",
      "description": "A complete rectangular page frame built on thin blue rods. The top bar carries a band of blue, orange and cream acanthus on gold between two knotted roundels; the left bar strings together knotted medallions, two six-pointed stars with red centres, gold bosses and leaf sprays; the right bar is a chain of acanthus leaves with a blue and orange pendant; the wide bottom bar is a gold band of scrolling acanthus with a quatrefoil medallion at its centre and small buds hanging below. Gold bosses with fine black rays are scattered around the outside; the centre and the background are transparent.",
